{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2393/content00792?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链案例&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2264d8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">引 言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">您知道威海的海产品产量多年全国地级市第一吗?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;威海海鲜&rdquo;的产地品牌虽然低调，但实力不容小觑! 为了让&ldquo;威海海鲜&rdquo;品牌走向更大舞台，京东物流展开与当地政府、供应链企业的合作，其中京东云仓一一京东物流供应链基地解决方案更是让&ldquo;威海海鲜&rdquo;的产地城市品牌鲜上加鲜!</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1693296967344.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1693297590083.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01397", "contentTitle": "京东云仓助力威海海鲜“鲜上+鲜”", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1693297611000, "id": 3316, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1693297610043.png", "updateTime": 1693297975000}}